  25:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****   @verbatim
  26:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****   ==============================================================================
  27:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****                        ##### SDMMC peripheral features #####
  28:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****   ==============================================================================
  29:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****     [..] The SD/SDMMC MMC card host interface (SDMMC) provides an interface between the AHB
  30:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****          peripheral bus and MultiMedia cards (MMCs), SD memory cards, SDMMC cards and CE-ATA
  31:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****          devices.
  32:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c **** 
  33:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****     [..] The SDMMC features include the following:
  34:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****          (+) Full compliance with MultiMediaCard System Specification Version 4.51. Card support
  35:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****              for three different databus modes: 1-bit (default), 4-bit and 8-bit.
  36:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****          (+) Full compatibility with previous versions of MultiMediaCards (backward compatibility).
  37:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****          (+) Full compliance with SD memory card specifications version 4.1.
  38:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****              (SDR104 SDMMC_CK speed limited to maximum allowed IO speed, SPI mode and
  39:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****               UHS-II mode not supported).
  40:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****          (+) Full compliance with SDIO card specification version 4.0. Card support
  41:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****              for two different databus modes: 1-bit (default) and 4-bit.
  42:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****              (SDR104 SDMMC_CK speed limited to maximum allowed IO speed, SPI mode and
  43:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****               UHS-II mode not supported).
  44:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****          (+) Data transfer up to 208 Mbyte/s for the 8 bit mode. (depending maximum allowed IO spee
  45:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****          (+) Data and command output enable signals to control external bidirectional drivers
  46:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c **** 
  47:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****                            ##### How to use this driver #####
  48:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****   ==============================================================================
  49:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****     [..]
  50:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****       This driver is a considered as a driver of service for external devices drivers
  51:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****       that interfaces with the SDMMC peripheral.
  52:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****       According to the device used (SD card/ MMC card / SDMMC card ...), a set of APIs
  53:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****       is used in the device's driver to perform SDMMC operations and functionalities.
  54:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c **** 
  55:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****       This driver is almost transparent for the final user, it is only used to implement other
  56:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****       functionalities of the external device.
  57:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c **** 
  58:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****     [..]
  59:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****       (+) The SDMMC clock is coming from output of PLL1_Q or PLL2_R.
  60:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****        Before start working with SDMMC peripheral make sure that the PLL is well configured.
  61:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****           The SDMMC peripheral uses two clock signals:
  62:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****           (++) PLL1_Q bus clock (default after reset)
  63:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****           (++) PLL2_R bus clock
  64:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c **** 
  65:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****       (+) Enable/Disable peripheral clock using RCC peripheral macros related to SDMMC
  66:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****           peripheral.
  67:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c **** 
  68:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****       (+) Enable the Power ON State using the SDMMC_PowerState_ON(SDMMCx)
  69:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****           function and disable it using the function SDMMC_PowerState_OFF(SDMMCx).
ARM GAS  C:\Users\Antonio\AppData\Local\Temp\cc9FRrj5.s 			page 3


  70:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c **** 
  71:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****       (+) Enable/Disable the peripheral interrupts using the macros __SDMMC_ENABLE_IT(hSDMMC, IT)
  72:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****           and __SDMMC_DISABLE_IT(hSDMMC, IT) if you need to use interrupt mode.
  73:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c **** 
  74:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****       (+) When using the DMA mode
  75:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****           (++) Configure the IDMA mode (Single buffer or double)
  76:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****           (++) Configure the buffer address
  77:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****           (++) Configure Data Path State Machine
  78:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c **** 
  79:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****       (+) To control the CPSM (Command Path State Machine) and send
  80:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****           commands to the card use the SDMMC_SendCommand(SDMMCx),
  81:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****           SDMMC_GetCommandResponse() and SDMMC_GetResponse() functions. First, user has
  82:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****           to fill the command structure (pointer to SDMMC_CmdInitTypeDef) according
  83:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****           to the selected command to be sent.
  84:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****           The parameters that should be filled are:
  85:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****            (++) Command Argument
  86:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****            (++) Command Index
  87:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****            (++) Command Response type
  88:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****            (++) Command Wait
  89:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****            (++) CPSM Status (Enable or Disable).
  90:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c **** 
  91:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****           -@@- To check if the command is well received, read the SDMMC_CMDRESP
  92:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****               register using the SDMMC_GetCommandResponse().
  93:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****               The SDMMC responses registers (SDMMC_RESP1 to SDMMC_RESP2), use the
  94:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****               SDMMC_GetResponse() function.
  95:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c **** 
  96:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****       (+) To control the DPSM (Data Path State Machine) and send/receive
  97:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****            data to/from the card use the SDMMC_DataConfig(), SDMMC_GetDataCounter(),
  98:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****           SDMMC_ReadFIFO(), SDMMC_WriteFIFO() and SDMMC_GetFIFOCount() functions.
  99:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c **** 
 100:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****     *** Read Operations ***
 101:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****     =======================
 102:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****     [..]
 103:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****       (#) First, user has to fill the data structure (pointer to
 104:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****           SDMMC_DataInitTypeDef) according to the selected data type to be received.
